Description: Test the distribution cryptography 49 family separately
 The upstream wheel installation remains pinned to cryptography 50.0.2.
 This distribution-only metadata change permits the separately tested system
 cryptography 49.0.0 package and its maintenance updates below version 50.
 It does not alter parser-distribution approval or declare Debian-installed
 bytes equivalent to an approved wheel. Actual compatibility evidence is
 recorded separately from upstream wheel validation.
